            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Uma viagem de bicicleta</strong>: Explore um novo mundo e percorra o seu caminho por paisagens deslumbrantes na sua bicicleta.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Documentar, fotografar e gravar</strong>: Recolha memórias, faça gravações e capture os momentos mais importantes da estação atual para preservá-los para as gerações futuras.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Um diário altamente personalizável</strong>: Junte as peças dos segredos do mundo de SEASON antes que um cataclismo leve tudo embora.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Personagens emocionalmente complexos</strong>: Conheça um elenco diversificado de personagens, cada um dos quais tem duas coisas preciosas para compartilhar contigo: as histórias das suas vidas e um momento juntos no final da temporada.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Uma narrativa envolvente</strong>: Esta jornada leva-te às grandes questões: o que é esta estação? Por que está a terminar? E o que trará a próxima estação?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Uma viagem de bicicleta</strong>: Explore um novo mundo e percorra o seu caminho por paisagens deslumbrantes na sua bicicleta.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/9de9f7dc19d07e1d57270dd94cbd0281.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Documentar, fotografar e gravar</strong>: Recolha memórias, faça gravações e capture os momentos mais importantes da estação atual para preservá-los para as gerações futuras.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/207a85996742b086c1432b6a1bf1cc54.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Um diário altamente personalizável</strong>: Junte as peças dos segredos do mundo de SEASON antes que um cataclismo leve tudo embora.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/5a93e1dd5bf84acb2ffc8400dd500337.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Personagens emocionalmente complexos</strong>: Conheça um elenco diversificado de personagens, cada um dos quais tem duas coisas preciosas para compartilhar contigo: as histórias das suas vidas e um momento juntos no final da temporada.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/06aff83e13d0213d2496f9db6843891f.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Uma narrativa envolvente</strong>: Esta jornada leva-te às grandes questões: o que é esta estação? Por que está a terminar? E o que trará a próxima estação?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.poster.avif?t=1786486834\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.webm?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695330/extras/0c8958016822e8f95f4e980e48d9e215.mp4?t=1786486834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "&quot;Deixa a tua casa pela primeira vez para recolher memórias antes que um cataclismo misterioso leve tudo. Pedala, grava, conhece pessoas e desvenda o estranho mundo à tua volta neste jogo de exploração meditativa em terceira pessoa.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês<strong>*</strong>, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Japonês<strong>*</strong>, Português (Brasil), Chinês simplificado, Chinês tradicional, Coreano<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
